        "en": "- **Smoother scrolling with long notes.** Timeline previews now do far less work when a note contains lengthy text or Markdown, so the list responds more smoothly.\r\n- **Lighter expand and collapse.** Opening or closing groups of long notes is faster, without changing the full contents of your notes or their appearance.",
